  "contentval": "0005Qzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/AM6/336",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: justify;\">계속 교내에서만 전학공을 하다가<br>이번에 교외 전학공 활동을 기획 운영하였습니다.<br><br><br>1. 일시 : 2024.10.16.(수) 14:30~16:30<br>2. 장소 : 대부도 방아머리 해수욕장 근처 카페<br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30f97862afbea3553ad254b5ff89843051d91384\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/30f97862afbea3553ad254b5ff89843051d91384\" data-origin-width=\"490\" data-origin-height=\"272\"></div><br>3. 주제 : 힐링~ (실제목적)<br>4. 운영방법<br>&#160; 1) 1인당 10,000원 협의회비 품의 (30만원)<br>&#160; 2) 아래의 빙고판 100개(1만원) 주문<br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7537684abc6f33d2b5f55196fd843168b8ffe1a8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7537684abc6f33d2b5f55196fd843168b8ffe1a8\" data-origin-width=\"333\" data-origin-height=\"442\"></div><br><br>3) 배송이 늦어 직접 제작후 출력<br><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1780ff402192db205d0ac4941d77838c9be1486\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1780ff402192db205d0ac4941d77838c9be1486\" data-origin-width=\"252\" data-origin-height=\"300\"></div><br><br>4) 카페로 집결 :<br>&#160; &#160;- 팀별로 커피 주문<br>&#160; &#160;- 카페에 외부 손님들이 있어서 마이크 사용을 못함. 카톡단톡방으로 게임진행<br><br><br>5) 워밍업 게임<br>&#160; - 빙고판과 볼펜을 나눠주고, 팀별로 빙고게임 시작<br>&#160; &#160;- 팀별 우승자에게 간단한 선물 증정<br><br><br>&#160;6) 본게임<br>&#160; &#160;- 빙고게임을 수업에 활용하는 방법을 팀별로 의논하여 단톡방에 올리기<br>&#160; &#160;- 단톡방에 올린 내용들을 읽어보고 각자 하트표시 하기(1회만 가능)&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&#160;<br>&#160; &#160;- 많은 하트를 받은 순서로 카페의 다양한 베이커리를 선물로 증정~<br><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7b0c1f8bbe25d2915a83cf67933d694102a9d0d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7b0c1f8bbe25d2915a83cf67933d694102a9d0d\" data-origin-width=\"315\" data-origin-height=\"223\"></div><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cb35455d3b9a0d088c1c6d7cd4993786aa24d7a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cb35455d3b9a0d088c1c6d7cd4993786aa24d7a\" data-origin-width=\"427\" data-origin-height=\"168\"></div><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54795b7a90fda2e1594bb90bdcb0ec5037754533\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54795b7a90fda2e1594bb90bdcb0ec5037754533\" data-origin-width=\"342\" data-origin-height=\"67\"></div>&#160;<br><br>7) 팀별 수다나눔<br><br><br>&#160;8) 정리활동<br>&#160; &#160;- 카페앞 바다에서 단체사진 찍고 Bye~</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
